  "findings": [
    "Native 1024-square level-5 crops retain detail missing from the same atlas level-2 8K image.",
    "The assembled 8K atlas has large near-black polar areas; its coverage differs markedly from the current composite.",
    "The catalogue identifies NASA Visible Earth but does not establish original observational resolution, detailed processing or polar fill.",
    "The source-grid registration check supports combining existing polar coverage with finer non-polar detail, but not treating the atlas as complete polar observations."
  ],
